{"repositoryId":195384051,"availability":"available","full":"flutter-food/BezierCurve","name":"BezierCurve","description":"Bezier curve master","category":"Other","language":"Objective-C","stars":46,"forks":13,"created":"2019-07-05T09:44:59Z","updated":"2019-07-05T11:15:34Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"master","homepage":null,"topics":["bezier","bezier-curve","component","curve","demo","flutter"],"demo":"https://www.ui.cn/detail/102368.html","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T20:35:34.224Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T20:35:34.224Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T20:35:34.224Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T20:35:34.224Z","stars":46,"forks":13}],"technologies":["Flutter"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["百度百科: 贝塞尔曲线(Bézier curve)，又称贝兹曲线或贝济埃曲线，是应用于二维图形应用程序的数学曲线。一般的矢量图形软件通过它来精确画出曲线，贝兹曲线由线段与节点组成，节点是可拖动的支点，线段像可伸缩的皮筋，我们在绘图工具上看到的钢笔工具就是来做这种矢量曲线的。贝塞尔曲线是计算机图形学中相当重要的参数曲线，在一些比较成熟的位图软件中也有贝塞尔曲线工具，如PhotoShop等。在Flash4中还没有完整的曲线工具，而在Flash5里面已经提供出贝塞尔曲线工具。"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/flutter-food/BezierCurve/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"ab5c075acdd7565b979c78f7bff136f9c4673b8358a52c0ec57bf84bebdcb4d0","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T20:35:34.321Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T20:35:34.321Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"百度百科: 贝塞尔曲线(Bézier curve)，又称贝兹曲线或贝济埃曲线，是应用于二维图形应用程序的数学曲线。一般的矢量图形软件通过它来精确画出曲线，贝兹曲线由线段与节点组成，节点是可拖动的支点，线段像可伸缩的皮筋，我们在绘图工具上看到的钢笔工具就是来做这种矢量曲线的。贝塞尔曲线是计算机图形学中相当重要的参数曲线，在一些比较成熟的位图软件中也有贝塞尔曲线工具，如PhotoShop等。在Flash4中还没有完整的曲线工具，而在Flash5里面已经提供出贝塞尔曲线工具。","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/flutter-food/BezierCurve/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"ab5c075acdd7565b979c78f7bff136f9c4673b8358a52c0ec57bf84bebdcb4d0","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/flutter-food/BezierCurve/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T20:35:34.321Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2019-07-05T11:15:34Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/